  The Amazon S3 API and Signature Version 4 (the gateway's interface)

=========================================================================
Prior work the design follows (docs/spec.md section 18)

  Sia v2 storage proofs: a small leaf proven into a Merkle root, the
    index taken from the block at a pinned height
    (SiaFoundation/core, types/types.go, V2StorageProof)
  "Pay for Storage using Proof of Retrievability on Bitcoin"
    (Xiaohui Liu, sCrypt, 2022): a block hash as the challenge's
    "publicly traceable and uncontrollable randomness source"

Third-party software is listed, with its licence text, in
LICENSE-THIRD-PARTY (Go) and in host/package-lock.json (the host module,
which inlines bcommon and imports the host's own @bsv/sdk).
